<title>POLAND: Espebepe falls in profit-taking.</title>
<headline>Espebepe falls in profit-taking.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Espebepe SA fell 6.7 percent to 4.2 zlotys in light trade in profit-taking after having enjoyed a speculative 45.2-percent surge since mid-December, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;The firm is in very poor fundamental conditional so if anyone was buying it must have been speculation,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Espepebe made a net loss of 20.6 million zlotys over 1996's first 11 months and its creditors are due to meet on March 14 to discuss its more than 35 million zlotys in debts.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
